ce both the number of units you receive as well as the number of units the recipient receives.<br><br>Units are worth real money (in pounds):&nbsp;you will receive 3 pence for each 100 units you earn, and your the other participant will also receive 3 pence for each 100 units they earn based on your decisions.<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID905","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Allocation Task \u00a0 Please indicate the distribution you prefer most, by choosing one of the distri...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID906","SecondaryAttribute":"Allocation Task \u00a0 Please indicate the distribution you prefer most, by choosing one of the distri..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14.5pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">Allocation Task<\/span><\/span><br>\n&nbsp;<br>Please indicate the distribution you prefer most, by choosing one of the distributions. Your choices will influence both the number of units you receive as well as the number of units the recipient receives.<br><br>Units are worth real money (in pounds): you will receive 3 pence for each 100 units you earn, and your the other participant will also receive 3 pence for each 100 units they earn based on your decisions.<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Allocation Task \u00a0 Please indicate the distribution you prefer most, by choosing one of the distri...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID906"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID704","SecondaryAttribute":"Allocation\u00a0Task In this task, you will be (randomly) paired with another participant who is also...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<font face=\"Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px;\"><b>Allocation&nbsp;<\/b><\/span><\/font><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14.5pt; font-weight: bolder;\">Task<\/span><font face=\"Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px;\"><b><br><\/b><\/span><\/font><div>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\">In this task, you will be (randomly) paired with another participant who is also participating in this study. We will refer to this other participant as the recipient.<br>\n<br>\nYou will be making a series of decisions about allocating units between you and the recipient. For each of the following questions, please indicate the distribution you prefer most, <strong>by choosing one of the distributions on the next pages.<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nThere are no right or wrong answers, this is all about personal preferences. As you can see, your choices will influence both the number of units you receive as well as the number of units the recipient receives.<br>\n<br>\nYour payment from this task will be added to your additional payment at the end of this study. The other participant (your recipient) will also receive an additional payment based on your decisions.<br><br>\nUnits are worth real money (in pounds). That is, 100 units equal 3 pence. This means that <strong>you will receive 3 pence for each 100 units you earn, and your recipient will receive 3 pence for each 100 units they earn based on your decisions.<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nPlease proceed to the next page to start with the allocation  task.<\/span><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"Data