":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions \u00a0 All units contributed to the common account will be multiplied with a certain fact...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":9,"NextAnswerId":1,"Graphics":"IM_3CoIbQjfQCrs32K","GraphicsDescription":"Dia15n","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><strong>All units contributed to the common account will be multiplied with a certain factor called <em>\"the Multiplier\"<\/em>.<\/strong> This means that every unit contributed to the common account will be worth more.&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>For example, if the Multiplier is 2 and a person contributes 10 units to the common account, the common account will consist of 2 x 10 = 20 units.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID517"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID519","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions \u00a0 At the end of the decision-making task, both persons earn: \u00a0 \u00a0the units that they.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><strong>At the end of the decision-making task, both persons earn:<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp;the units that they receive from the common account<br>\n+ the units that they kept.<\/strong><br>\n&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>This means that if a person kept 20 units and got 10 units from the common account, this person will earn 20 (the number of units kept) + 10 (the number&nbsp;of units from the common account) = 30 units.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"GRB","SubSelector":"WTXB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions \u00a0 At the end of the decision-making task, both persons earn: \u00a0 \u00a0the units that they...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"Graphics":"IM_3BKcLjUVdImpXtr","GraphicsDescription":"Dia25n","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<strong>Both persons will earn what they have kept + what they got from the common account.<\/strong>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>This means that if a person kept 20 units and got 10 units from the common account, this person will earn 20 (the number of units kept) + 10 (the number&nbsp;of units from the common account) = 30 units.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID519"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID520","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions \u00a0 At this point, it is important that you understand the general rules of this task...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\nAt this point, it is important that you understand the general rules of this task. Please answer the following practice questions to continue.","QuestionDescription":"Instructions \u00a0 At this point, it is important that you understand the general rules of this task....","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\nAt this point, it is important that you understand the general rules of this task. Please answer the following practice questions to continue the experiment.","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID520"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID511","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions \u00a0 \u00a0 The main decision-making task will now start! Please read the instructions caref.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14.5pt;\">Instructions<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\">The main decision-making task will now start!<br>\n<br><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Please read the instructions carefully.<\/span><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions \u00a0 \u00a0 The main decision-making task will now start! Please read the instructions caref...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionJS":false,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14.5pt;\">Welcome and thank you for participating in this study<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;<\/p><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Please read the instructions on the next pages carefully.<\/span><\/p>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID511"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID514","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions \u00a0 Both persons have to decide how much of their Income they want to contribute to a...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<strong>Both persons have to decide how much of their Income they want to contribute to a common account and how much to keep for themselves. <\/strong>Both persons can distribute their Income freely across these options.<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><div>Neither person is informed about the decision of the other person.&nbsp;<\/div><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"GRB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions \u00a0 Both persons have to decide how much of their Income they want to contribute to a...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":9,"NextAnswerId":1,"SubSelector":"WTXB","Graphics":"IM_5cktdAHXyEbkg3Y","GraphicsDescription":"Distribute","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<strong>Both persons have to decide how much of their Income they want to contribute to a common account and how much to keep for themselves. <\/strong>Both persons can distribute their Income freely across these options.<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><div>Neither person is informed about the decision of the other person.&nbsp;<\/div><\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID514"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID534","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions \u00a0 Example \u00a0 Both Type 2 and Type 3 can choose between contributing to the common acc.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: bolder;\">Example<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Both Type 2 and Type 3 can choose between contributing to the common account or keeping their Income.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions \u00a0 Example \u00a0 Both Type 2 and Type 3 can choose between contributing to the common acc...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"Graphics":"IM_bjUsqH0PJzdvBS5","GraphicsDescription":"Dia31nn","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: bolder;\"><br><\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: bolder;\">Example<\/span><\/div><\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Both Type 2 and Type 3 can choose between contributing to the common account or keeping their Income.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>The person with Type 2 decides to contribute 50 units to the common account and to keep 25 units.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Since Type 2 has a Multiplier of 1.3, this person thus contributes 50 x 1.3 = 65 units to the common account.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID534"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID537","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions \u00a0 Example \u00a0 The common account is shared equally among both persons, regardless of h.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: bolder;\">Example<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>The common account is <strong>shared equally<\/strong> among both persons, regardless of how much they contributed or what Type they are.<br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Both persons will thus receive 82&nbsp;&divide; 2 = 41 units from the common account.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"GRB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions \u00a0 Example \u00a0 The common account is shared equally among both persons, regardless of h...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"SubSelector":"WTXB","Graphics":"IM_1NtWwoZJmfA8p1z","GraphicsDescription":"Dia36n","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: bolder;\"><br><\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: bolder;\">Example<\/span><\/div><\/div><div><br><\/div><div>The total amount of the common account is split evenly among both persons, regardless of whether they contributed.<br>\n&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Both persons will thus receive 82 : 2 = 41 units on top of the units they have kept.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID537"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID532","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions \u00a0 Here are the rules again: \u00a0 Each person\u00a0will be assigned a certain Type: A person'","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:19px;\"><strong>Instructions &nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nHere are the rules again: &nbsp;<br \/>\n<br \/>\nEach person&nbsp;will be assigned a certain <strong>Type<\/strong>:\n<ul>\n\t<li>A person&#39;s Income is either 75 or 25 units.<\/li>\n\t<li>A person&#39;s Multiplier is either 1.7 or 1.3. &nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br \/>\nTwo persons will be <strong>paired <\/strong>to participate in the decision-making task together.<br \/>\nBefore the start of the task, both persons will&nbsp;be informed about their own and their&nbsp;partner&#39;s Type. &nbsp;<br \/>\n<br \/>\nBoth persons decide how many units to <strong>contribute <\/strong>to the common account and how many units to <strong>keep<\/strong>.\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Both persons can distribute their <strong>Income <\/strong>(75 or 25 units) freely across these options. &nbsp;<\/li>\n\t<li>Units contributed to the common account will be multiplied by each person&#39;s <strong>Multiplier <\/strong>(1.7&nbsp;or 1.3).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br \/>\nAfter multiplication, units in the common account will be <strong>equally divided<\/strong> among&nbsp;both persons. &nbsp;<br \/>\n<br \/>\nAt the end of the task, each person <strong>earns<\/strong>:&nbsp;<br \/>\n&nbsp; &nbsp;the units that they receive back from the common account<br \/>\n+ the units that they kept.","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions \u00a0 Here are the rules again: \u00a0 Each person\u00a0will be assigned a certain Type: A person'...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Here are the rules again:<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Each person&nbsp;will be assigned a certain Type.<\/li>\n\t<li>A person's Income is either 75 or 25 units.<\/li>\n\t<li>A person's Multiplier is either 1.7 or 1.3.<\/li>\n\t<li>Two persons are paired and engage in a simple task.<\/li>\n\t<li>Before the start of the task, both persons will&nbsp;be informed about their partner's Type.<\/li>\n\t<li>Both persons decide how many units of their Income they want to contribute to the common account and how many units they want to keep.<\/li>\n\t<li>Both persons can distribute their Income freely across these options.<\/li>\n\t<li>Units contributed to the common account will be multiplied by each person's Multiplier (1.7&nbsp;or 1.3).<\/li>\n\t<li>After multiplication, units in the common account will be equally divided among&nbsp;both persons.<\/li>\n\t<li>Each person will earn the number of units that they receive back from the common account + the units that they kept.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID532"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID518","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions \u00a0 Once multiplied, the total number of units in the common account is split evenly a..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Once multiplied, <strong>the total number of units in the common account is split evenly among both persons.<\/strong><br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Thus, if the common account consists of 20 units, each person will receive 20&nbsp;&divide; 2 = 10 units.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"GRB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions \u00a0 Once multiplied, the total number of units in the common account is split evenly a...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"SubSelector":"WTXB","Graphics":"IM_3CxI8SyxjevHvOR","GraphicsDescription":"Dia24n","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\nOnce multiplied, <strong>the total amount of units in the&nbsp;common account&nbsp;is split evenly among both persons<\/strong>, regardless of how much they contributed to the common account.\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Thus, if the common account consists of 20 units, each person will receive 20 : 2 = 10 units.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID518"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID527","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions \u00a0 Person's Income and Multiplier define what Type they are. There are 4 different Ty..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Person&#39;s <strong>Income <\/strong>and <strong>Multiplier <\/strong>define what Type they are. <strong>There are 4 different Types.<\/strong><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Both persons will be assigned one of these Types. Before the start of the task, both persons will learn about each other&#39;s Type.<\/div>\n\n<div><br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>You can see the different Types on the next page.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions \u00a0 Person's Income and Multiplier define what Type they are. There are 4 different Ty...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Graphics":"IM_8cVHpbUNiouZ2ER","GraphicsDescription":"Dia15 new","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Person's Income and Multiplier define what Type they are. There exist 4 different Types.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Both persons will be assigned one of these Types. Before the start of the task, both persons will learn about each other's Type.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>These 4 Types are introduced on the next page.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID527"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID515","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions \u00a0 So, persons have 2 options in distributing their Income. First, they can decide to..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>So, persons have 2 options in distributing their Income.<\/div><div><br><\/div>\nFirst, <strong>they can decide to keep units.<\/strong> In this case, the units remain theirs.","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"GRB","SubSelector":"WTXB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions \u00a0 So, persons have 2 options in distributing their Income. First, they can decide to...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"Graphics":"IM_5vvfkLJ3fslW6ax","GraphicsDescription":"Dia8 new","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>So, persons have 2 options in distributing their Income.<\/div><div><br><\/div>\nFirst, <strong>they can decide to keep the units.<\/strong> In this case, nothing happens, and the units remain theirs.","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID515"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID525","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions \u00a0 The Income of a person can be either 75 or 25 units.\u00a0 \u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>The <strong>Income <\/strong>of a person can be either 75 or 25 units.&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"GRB","SubSelector":"WTXB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions \u00a0 The Income of a person can be either 75 or 25 units.\u00a0 \u00a0","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Graphics":"IM_51DPEhasw7foJRb","GraphicsDescription":"Dia8 new","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div><div><br><\/div><div>The Income of a person is 75 or 25 units.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID525"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID526","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions \u00a0 The Multiplier of a person can be either 1.7 or 1.3.\u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\nThe <strong>Multiplier <\/strong>of a person can be either 1.7 or 1.3.&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"GRB","SubSelector":"WTXB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions \u00a0 The Multiplier of a person can be either 1.7 or 1.3.\u00a0","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Graphics":"IM_8x0eWGJhyviYKs5","GraphicsDescription":"Dia9 new","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\nThe Multiplier of a person is 1.7 or 1.3.&nbsp;","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID526"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID513","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions \u00a0 This main\u00a0decision-making task is performed by two persons.\u00a0Each person receives a","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>This main&nbsp;decision-making task is performed by two persons.&nbsp;<strong>Each person receives a certain number of units (Income).&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/strong><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"GRB","SubSelector":"WTXB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions \u00a0 This main\u00a0decision-making task is performed by two persons.\u00a0Each person receives a...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"Graphics":"IM_0OfcYVZqACiUqVf","GraphicsDescription":"Dia6 new","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>This decision-making task is performed by two persons. <strong>Each person receives a certain number of unites (Income).&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/strong><\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID513"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID533","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions Below you can find a hypothetical scenario. This scenario is just an example that ai...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>\n<div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div><br \/>\nBelow you can find a hypothetical scenario. This scenario is just an example that aims to explain the rules of the task.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: bolder;\">Example<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>In the current example, a person of Type 2 is paired with another person of Type 3.<\/div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Type 2 has an Income of 75 units and a Multiplier of 1.3.<\/li>\n\t<li>Type 3 has an Income of 25 units and a Multiplier of 1.7.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"GRB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions Below you can find a hypothetical scenario. This scenario is just an example that ai...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"SubSelector":"WTXB","Graphics":"IM_1BUAL9JUgBH6Hm5","GraphicsDescription":"Dia17 new","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div><\/div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\"><br><\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: bolder;\">Example<\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; font-size: 19.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/div><div>The following example will illustrate the rules of the experiment. This example is for illustrative purposes only.<\/div><\/div><div><br><\/div><div>In this example a person of Type 2 is paired with another person of Type 3.<br>\n&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Type 2 has an Income of 75 and a Multiplier of 1.3.<\/div>\n\n<div>Type 3 has an Income of 25 and a Multiplier of 1.7.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID533"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID528","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions Type 1 Type 1 has an Income of 75 units and a Multiplier of 1.7.\u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px;\"><strong><br><\/strong><\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px;\"><strong>Type 1<\/strong><\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px;\"><strong><br><\/strong><\/span><\/div><div>Type 1 has an Income of 75 units and a Multiplier of 1.7.&nbsp;<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"GRB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions Type 1 Type 1 has an Income of 75 units and a Multiplier of 1.7.\u00a0","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":10,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"SubSelector":"WTXB","Graphics":"IM_6ffAvBnfkf7xGpD","GraphicsDescription":"Dia1n","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions<\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px;\"><strong><br><\/strong><\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px;\"><strong>Type 1<\/strong><\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px;\"><strong><br><\/strong><\/span><\/div><div>Type 1 has an Income of 75 and a Multiplier of 1.7.&nbsp;<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID528"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID524","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions\u00a0 \u00a0 Persons can differ: a) in their\u00a0Income: the units a person has and b) in their\u00a0M","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions&nbsp;<\/span>\n<div>&nbsp;<br>\nPersons can differ:<br>\n<br>\na) in their&nbsp;<strong>Income<\/strong>: the units a person has<br>\n<br>\nand<br>\n<br>\nb) in their&nbsp;<strong>Multiplier<\/strong>: by how much units are multiplied when contributed to the common account.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"GRB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions\u00a0 \u00a0 Persons can differ: a) in their\u00a0Income: the units a person has and b) in their\u00a0Mu...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Graphics":"IM_5B8TUpNJMMQW3u6","GraphicsDescription":"Incomemultiplierinstructions","SubSelector":"WTXB","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Instructions&nbsp;<\/span><div><br><\/div><div>Both persons can differ in their Income and Multiplier.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID524"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1212728621","SecondaryAttribute":"Introduction \u00a0 In the previous block, you indicated what Type you prefer to be paired with, as we..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Introduction<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<div>In the previous block, you indicated what Type you prefer to be paired with, as well as your second, third, and fourth choice. After the task, we will try to pair everyone with their preferred Type.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>In the upcoming block, we will ask you, for each possible partner, how many units of your Income you want to <strong>contribute <\/strong>to the common account, and how many units you <strong>believe <\/strong>your partner will contribute.&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>We ask you to indicate this for each possible partner, since we might not be able to pair everyone with their preferred Type. If you cannot be paired with your preferred Type, you will be paired with your second, third, or fourth choice.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Because pairs are realized after the task, you do not know with which Type you actually will be paired. <strong>You therefore should treat each partner in the next block as if this is the Type that will be selected for payout.<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Introduction \u00a0 In the previous block, you indicated what Type you prefer to be paired with, as we...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Introduction<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<div>In the previous block, you indicated what Type you prefer to be paired with, as well as your second, third, and fourth choice. After the experiment, we will try to pair everyone with their preferred Type.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>In the upcoming block, we will ask you, for each possible pairing, how many units of your Income you want to <strong>contribute <\/strong>to the common account, and how many units you <strong>believe <\/strong>your partner will contribute.&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>We ask you to indicate this for each possible pairing, since we might not be able to pair everyone with their preferred Type. If you cannot be paired with your preferred Type, you will be paired with your second, third, or fourth choice.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Because pairings are realized after the experiment, you do not know with which Type you actually will be paired with. <strong>You therefore should treat each pairing in the next block as if this is the pairing that will be selected for payout.<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID1212728621"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1212728622","SecondaryAttribute":"Introduction \u00a0 Please remember that units are worth real money. Your decisions therefore impact y..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Introduction<\/span>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<p>Please remember that units are worth <strong>real money<\/strong>. Your decisions therefore impact your additional payment as well as the additional payment of another participant.&nbsp;<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThe conversion rate is: <strong>25 units = &pound;1.00.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p><br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>Furthermore, you can earn an additional bonus when asked about how much you believe your partner will contribute to the common account. If your answer corresponds to the exact contribution of your partner, you will receive a bonus of <strong>0.20 pound<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Introduction \u00a0 Please remember that units are worth real money. Your decisions therefore impact y...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Introduction<\/span>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<p>Please remember that units are worth <strong>real money<\/strong>. Your decisions therefore impact your actual payment as well as the payment of another participant.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>Furthermore, you can earn an additional bonus when asked about how much you believe your partner will contribute to the common account. If your answer corresponds to the exact contribution of your partner, you will receive a bonus of <strong>.10 pound<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID1212728622"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1212728608","SecondaryAttribute":"Introduction\u00a0 \u00a0 After the task, we will try to pair all participants with their preferred Type. \u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Introduction&nbsp;<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>After the task, we will try to pair all participants with their preferred Type.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>However, if it is not possible to pair you with your preferred Type, because participants of this Type did not prefer your Type, you will be paired with your second choice. If this is not possible, you will be paired with your third choice, etc.<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<i>Note: Some participants will not be paired based on their partner preference. Instead, they will be paired based on the decision of another participant. A coin flip will determine if you will be paired based on your partner preferences or by <\/i><em>another<\/em><i><em>&nbsp;<\/em>participant. More information will be provided later in this task. However, because pairs are created after the task, you should treat this block as if your partner preferences will be selected for payout.<\/i><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Introduction\u00a0 \u00a0 After the task, we will try to pair all participants with their preferred Type. \u00a0...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Introduction&nbsp;<\/span><\/div><div><br><\/div><div>After the experiment, we will try to pair all participants with their preferred Type.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>However, if it is not possible to pair you with your preferred Type, because the person of this Type did not prefer your Type, you will be paired with your second choice. If this is not possible, you will be paired with your third choice, etc.&nbsp;<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID1212728608"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1212728607","SecondaryAttribute":"Introduction\u00a0 \u00a0 In the current block you can choose what Type you prefer to be paired with.\u00a0 \u00a0 Y","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; font-size: 19.3333px;\">Introduction&nbsp;<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\nIn the current block <strong>you can choose what Type you prefer to be paired with.&nbsp;<\/strong>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>You will be paired with your preferred Type (your first choice) if another participant of this Type also prefers to be paired with your Type.<br>\n<br>\nFor instance, if you prefer to be paired with Type 1, and another person with Type 1 prefers to be paired with your Type, then you will be paired with each other.<br><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Introduction\u00a0 \u00a0 In the current block you can choose what Type you prefer to be paired with.\u00a0 \u00a0 Yo...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; font-size: 19.3333px;\">Introduction&nbsp;<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\nIn the current block <strong>you can choose what Type you prefer to be paired with.&nbsp;<\/strong>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<div>You will be paired with your preferred Type (your first choice) if another person of this Type also prefers to be paired with your Type.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<div>For instance, if you prefer to be paired with Type 1, and Type 1 prefers to be paired with your Type, then you will be paired.&nbsp;<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID1212728607"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID613","SecondaryAttribute":"List of Countries","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"In which country do you currently reside?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"DL","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","NumColumns":2,"LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"List of Countries","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Afghanistan"},"2":{"Display":"Albania"},"3":{"Display":"Algeria"},"4":{"Display":"Andorra"},"5":{"Display":"Angola"},"6":{"Display":"Antigua and Barbuda"},"7":{"Display":"Argentina"},"8":{"Display":"Armenia"},"9":{"Display":"Australia"},"10":{"Display":"Austria"},"11":{"Display":"Azerbaijan"},"12":{"Display":"Bahamas"},"13":{"Display":"Bahrain"},"14":{"Display":"Bangladesh"},"15":{"Display":"Barbados"},"16":{"Display":"Belarus"},"17":{"Display":"Belgium"},"18":{"Display":"Belize"},"19":{"Display":"Benin"},"20":{"Display":"Bhutan"},"21":{"Display":"Bolivia"},"22":{"Display":"Bosnia and Herzegovina"},"23":{"Display":"Botswana"},"24":{"Display":"Brazil"},"25":{"Display":"Brunei Darussalam"},"26":{"Display":"Bulgaria"},"27