r \/>\n<br \/>\nTherefore, in this example:\n<ul>\n\t<li>The person with Type 2 <strong>earns<\/strong>&nbsp;<br \/>\n\t25 (units kept) +&nbsp;41 (from the common account) = 66 units.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\t<li>The person with Type 3 <strong>earns<\/strong>&nbsp;<br \/>\n\t15 (units kept) +&nbsp;41 (from the common account)&nbsp;= 56 units.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Participants earn the units that they kept + the units they got from the common account. Therefor...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"This means that the person with Type 2 will earn 41 (from the common account) + 25 (units kept) = 66 units.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>The person with Type 3 will earn 41 (from the common account) + 15 (units kept) = 56 units.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID538"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID543","SecondaryAttribute":"Persons can differ in their Income and Multiplier","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Persons can differ in their Income and Multiplier","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Persons can differ in their Income and Multiplier","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Correct"},"2":{"Display":"Incorrect"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"CustomValidation","CustomValidation":{"Logic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID543\/SelectableChoice\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Persons can differ in their Income and Multiplier<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Correct<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/