ing (bottom). After the experiment we will try to pair you with your preferred Type, based on the ranking you provide here.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>You can click on each item and then drag and drop it in your preferred order.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Preference","QuestionID":"QID1212728617"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1212728609","SecondaryAttribute":"Practice questions \u00a0 Please answer the following practice questions correctly to continue with th..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Practice questions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<div>Please answer the following practice questions correctly to continue with the study.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>I will always be paired with my most preferred Type (my first choice).<\/div>\n<\/div>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Practice questions \u00a0 Please answer the following practice questions correctly to continue with th...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Correct"},"2":{"Display":"Incorrect"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"CustomValidation","CustomValidation":{"Logic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1212728609\/SelectableChoice\/2","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Practice QuestionsYou will always be paired with your most preferred choice<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Incorrect<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1212728609\/SelectableChoice\/2","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1212728609","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1212728609","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression"},"Message":{"description":"You did not answer this question correctly. Please try again.","libraryID":"UR_cwECFhUfTmDesIJ","messageID":"MS_9ET8RdUvu3jNhqd","subMessageID":"VE_CUSTOM_VALIDATION_0"}}}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px; font-weight: 700;\">Practice Questions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<div>Please answer the following practice questions to continue the experiment.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>You will always be paired with your most preferred choice<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>","DataExportTag":"PQpref1","QuestionID":"QID1212728609"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID545","SecondaryAttribute":"Practice questions \u00a0 Please calculate the earnings for the following, hypothetical scenario. The...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>\n<div><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; font-size: 19.3333px;\">Practice questions<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div>Please calculate the earnings for the following, hypothetical scenario. The scenario is just an example and aimed to test your understanding of the rules of the task.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>You may use a calculator.<\/div>\n\n<div><br>\n&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>In this example, a person of Type 1 is paired with another person of Type 4:<\/div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>The person with Type 1 has an Income of 75 units and a Multiplier of 1.7.<\/li>\n\t<li>The person with Type 4 has an Income of 25 units and a Multiplier of 1.3.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"GRB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Practice questions \u00a0 Please calculate the earnings for the following, hypothetical scenario. The...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextA