r is that the rich have had more luck in life than the poor."},"6":{"Display":"In my country, one of the main reasons for the rich being richer than the poor is that the rich were born with greater abilities than the poor."},"7":{"Display":"In my country, if the government increases the taxes that the rich have to pay, the rich will work less and invest less."}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":13,"NextAnswerId":8,"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"strongly disagree"},"2":{"Display":"disagree somewhat"},"3":{"Display":"neither agree<br \/>\nnor disagree"},"4":{"Display":"agree somewhat"},"5":{"Display":"strongly agree"}},"AnswerOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"QuestionID":"QID953"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID954","SecondaryAttribute":"Questionnaire Do you generally agree, disagree, or neither agree nor disagree with the following...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:19px;\"><strong>Questionnaire<\/strong><\/span><br>\n<br>Do you generally agree, disagree, or neither agree nor disagree with the following statements.<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Beliefs2","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Questionnaire Do you generally agree, disagree, or neither agree nor disagree with the following...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"In [my country, one of the main reasons for the rich being richer than the poor is that the rich have been more selfish in life than the poor."},"5":{"Display":"In my country, one of the main reasons for the rich being richer than the po