her agree nor disagree with the following...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"In [COUNTRY], one of the main reasons for the rich being richer than the poor is that the rich have been more selfish in life than the poor."},"5":{"Display":"In [COUNTRY], one of the main reasons for the rich being richer than the poor is that the rich are more willing than the poor to give up something today to benefit from that in the future."},"6":{"Display":"In [COUNTRY], one of the main reasons for the rich being richer than the poor is that the rich are more willing to take economic risks than the poor."},"7":{"Display":"In [COUNTRY], one of the main reasons for the rich being richer than the poor is that the rich have parents or other family members that provided them with greater opportunities than the poor."},"13":{"Display":"In [COUNTRY], one of the main reasons for the rich being richer than the poor is that the rich have been more involved in illegal activities than the poor."}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","5","6","7","13"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":14,"NextAnswerId":10,"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"strongly disagree"},"2":{"Display":"disagree somewhat"},"3":{"Display":"neither agree<br \/>\nnor disagree"},"8":{"Display":"Click to write Scale Point 4"},"9":{"Display":"Click to write Scale Point 5"}},"AnswerOrder":["1","2","3","8","9"],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"QuestionID":"QID955"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID956","SecondaryAttribute":"Questionnaire Do you generally agree, disagree, or neither agree nor disagree with the following...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:19px;\"><strong>Questionnaire<\/strong><\/span><br>\n<br>Do you generally agree, disagree, or neither agree nor disagree with the following statements.<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Attitudes","QuestionType":"Matrix","Se