ull Income<\/u> to the common account. Here, we will ask you to <strong>redistribute <\/strong>units that are in the common account.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>There are no right or wrong answers, this is all about your personal preferences.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Redistribution \u00a0\u00a0 In the following scenarios, two Types were paired, and both Types contributed t...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"Graphics":"IM_01k0hdELONyibhH","GraphicsDescription":"Dia15 new","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 19.3333px;\"><strong>Contributions<\/strong><\/span><\/div>\n&nbsp;\n\n<div>Here, we will ask you <strong>how many units you think others should contribute to the common account.<\/strong> Remember that the common account will be split evenly among both persons.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>There are no right or wrong answers, this is all about personal preferences. <br><\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID710"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID769","SecondaryAttribute":"Remember, you are ${e:\/\/Field\/role_self}. You have an Income of ${e:\/\/Field\/endowement_self} unit...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><strong>Remember, you are ${e:\/\/Field\/role_self}<\/strong>. You have an Income of ${e:\/\/Field\/endowement_self} units and a Multiplier of ${e:\/\/Field\/multiplier_self}.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"GRB","SubSelector":"WTXB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Remember, you are ${e:\/\/Field\/role_self}. You have an Income of ${e:\/\/Field\/endoweme