,"Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID29","SecondaryAttribute":"Thank you for participating in this study! In this study, your decisions had an actual impact on...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.5pt; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Thank you for participating in this study!<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 15.3333px;\">In this study, your decisions had an actual impact on your payment as well as on the payment of other participants. <\/span><strong style=\"font-size: 15.3333px;\">The study did not involve any deception<\/strong><span style=\"font-size: 15.3333px;\">: Everything that was described in the instructions did in fact happen and\/or will be implemented upon completion of the study.<\/span><br>\n<br><span style=\"font-size: 15.3333px;\">\nThis study will help us to better understand <\/span><strong style=\"font-size: 15.3333px;\">how <\/strong><span style=\"font-size: 15.3333px;\">inequality impacts partner selection, cooperation, and the redistribution of wealth.<\/span><br>\n<br><span style=\"font-size: 15.3333px;\">\nFor further information, please contact Luuk Snijder (l.snijder@fsw.leidenuniv.nl), the principal investigator Dr. Mirre Stallen (m.stallen@fsw.leidenuniv.nl), or our Data Privacy Officer (privacy@fsw.leidenuniv.nl).<\/span><br>\n<br><span style=\"font-size: 15.3333px;\">\nAgain, thank you for your participation!<\/span><br>\n<br><span style=\"font-size: 15.3333px;\">\nWhen all participants have finished this study, you will receive your additional&nbsp;payment. This will approximately take 14 days. Thank you for your patience.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 15.3333px;\">Please proceed to the next page to return to Prolific.<\/span><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Thank you for participating in this study! In this study, your decisions had an actual impact on...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID29","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1212728623","SecondaryAttribute":"The block will start Please proceed to the next page to start.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; font-size: 19.3333px;\">The block will start<\/span><\/div><div><br><\/div><\/div><div>Please proceed to the next page to start.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"The block will start Please proceed to the next page to start.","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; font-size: 19.3333px;\">The next block will start<\/span><\/div><div><br><\/div><\/div><div>Please proceed to the next page to start the next block.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID1212728623"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID536","SecondaryAttribute":"The common account for this pair consists of 65 + 17 = 82 units.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>The common account for this pair consists of 65 + 17 = 82 units.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"GRB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"The common account for this pair consists of 65 + 17 = 82 units.","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"Graphics":"IM_4TSlvQNvnMBlPhj","GraphicsD