ue with the questionnaire.<br><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"The end of the decision-making task \u00a0\u00a0 The earnings from this decision-making task will be added...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div>\n<div><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; font-size: 19.3333px;\">The next block will start<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div>This is the end of the current block.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Please proceed to the next page to start the next block.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID768"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1212728606","SecondaryAttribute":"The first block will start Please proceed to the next page to begin with the task.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; font-size: 19.3333px;\">The first block will start<\/span><\/div><div><br><\/div><\/div><div>Please proceed to the next page to begin with the task.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"The first block will start Please proceed to the next page to begin with the task.","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; font-size: 19.3333px;\">The first block will start<\/span><\/div><div><br><\/div><\/div><div>Please proceed to the next page to go to the introduction of the first block.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Text","QuestionID":"QID1212728606"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_033u4aMDr5refGe","Ele